# API + React Query

Ver `architecture/007-api-pattern.md`.

## Regras

- Nunca `fetch` solto — use `shared/api` (ApiClient)
- Preferir Server Actions + services no App Router
- ApiClient + React Query só quando a UI precisar de cache/polling/interatividade

## React Query

- Factories em `modules/<feature>/queries/` e `mutations/`
- Hooks (`usePatients`) encapsulam `useQuery` — não espalhar `useQuery(...)` em pages

```
ApiClient → AuthInterceptor → Request → Response → ErrorHandler
```
